    "detailed_description": "There's a strange town on the outskirts.<br>They say that something beyond belief happens there.<br>They say that almost every person that goes there does not return.<br>They say that the few ones who manage to return never speak about what they saw.<br>They also say that an entity from another world hides in the sewers, but that's irrelevant to this story.<br>They say the sort of things that make you too curious about unknown dangers even when the rational part of your brain tells you not to. In several languages. With a megaphone.<br>The town they speak about is in front of you. Will you live to tell the tale?<br><i>Wait, wait, wait, weren\u2019t we here before?</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755320/extras/d06c7f49cd0461f73b3cfa6774f11bf5.poster.avif?t=1739028831\" width=610 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755320/extras/d06c7f49cd0461f73b3cfa6774f11bf5.webm?t=1739028831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755320/extras/d06c7f49cd0461f73b3cfa6774f11bf5.mp4?t=1739028831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Badcome back.<br>Until it\u2019s Undone, the anti-point-and-click in which you unmake puzzles by typing, has returned, weirder than ever. It\u2019s a short ride, but one that will stick with you like a limpet made of wonder and confusion.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete graphic overhaul with sprites created from home-taken pictures, plus a few stock images and doodles.<br></li><li>New minigame sections centered around twisting popular game mechanics into something almost unrecognizable.<br></li><li>Expanded soundtrack.<br></li><li>A few alternative puzzle solutions.<br></li><li>Plenty of optimizations.<br></li><li>85% more body horror.<br></li><li>Even more sarcasm.<br></li><li>A giant spider (kinda).</li></ul><br>It\u2019s time to go back to the lost town, one last time.",
